==============================================================
                    Request For Quotation
==============================================================

RFQ No.            : <%= @order.try(:rfq_no).presence || @order.try(:reference_no).presence || "—" %>
Inquiry Due Date   : <%= @inquiry_due_date.presence || "—" %>
Inquiry Address    : Sector M41 - Abu Dhabi Industrial City - ICAD I - Abu Dhabi PO Box 93543

Please provide the best quotation for the below inquiry.
Note: Please include the delivery charge to this address.

--------------------------------------------------------------

Dear <%= @selection.supplier_name %> Sales Team,

We are AtoZ2010 Inc. (Procurement Department), reaching out regarding the following items.
We would like to receive your best quotation including unit price, lead time, MOQ, and shipping terms.

ITEMS REQUESTED
--------------------------------------------------------------
<% @items.each_with_index do |item, i| %>
<%
  name         = item[:name].presence         || item["name"] || "—"
  spec         = item[:spec].presence         || item["spec"]
  model        = item[:model].presence        || item["model"]
  part_no      = item[:part_no].presence      || item["part_no"]
  manufacturer = item[:manufacturer].presence || item["manufacturer"] || item[:brand].presence || item["brand"]
  unit         = item[:unit].presence         || item["unit"] || "—"
  qty          = item[:quantity].presence     || item["quantity"] || "—"
  remarks      = item[:remarks].presence      || item["remarks"] || item[:certification].presence || item["certification"]
%>
[<%= i + 1 %>] <%= name %>
    Model/Part No.: <%= part_no.presence || model.presence || "—" %>
    Manufacturer  : <%= manufacturer.presence || "—" %>
    Spec          : <%= spec.presence || "—" %>
    Unit / Qty    : <%= unit %> / <%= qty %>
    Remarks       : <%= remarks.presence || "—" %>

<% end %>

REQUIREMENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------
- Quotation in writing with unit price, lead time, MOQ.
- Delivery: <%= @order.try(:client)&.country.presence || "South Korea / UAE — please advise on Incoterms" %>
- Certifications: please indicate KS / CE / API / ATEX / ISO compliance where applicable.
<% if @inquiry_due_date.present? %>- Reply by: <%= @inquiry_due_date %><% end %>

==============================================================

If you have further clarifications, please do not hesitate to contact us.

Thank you.
Best regards,
<%= @from_user&.display_name.presence || "Mike Lee" %>

Email: <%= @from_user&.email.presence || "sales@atoz2010.com" %>
+971 2 553 5580

A TO Z SUPPLY CHAIN TRADING LLC
sales@atoz2010.com / +971 2 553 5580 / Musaffah, Abu Dhabi, UAE
